\begin{abstract}
We reduce the supplied U222 primary candidate to an explicit deterministic
single-tape, two-symbol Turing machine with \textbf{218 working states and
436 transitions}, including blank-tape initialization. The improvement is
four states relative to U222 and twenty relative to the requested 238-state
