\begin{enumerate}
\item \textbf{Can relational tape facts remove another state?}
The present abstraction records independent cell values. Equalities
between neighboring cells, phase information, or disjunctions of small
patterns may justify identifications it cannot find. Each proposed fold
should produce an inductive invariant and a commuting-step certificate.

\item \textbf{Can compiler passes exploit known symbols systematically?}
A post-allocation pass could discover forced-symbol rows, select a
compatible existing state, and emit the exact invariant proof obligation.
This would capture savings missed by ordinary whole-table bisimulation.
\end{enumerate}

